\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： גּוֹרָל</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： goral)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016008\" data-end-ref=\"03016008\">LEV 16:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016008\" data-end-ref=\"03016008\">LEV 16:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016008\" data-end-ref=\"03016008\">LEV 16:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016009\" data-end-ref=\"03016009\">LEV 16:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016010\" data-end-ref=\"03016010\">LEV 16:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04026055\" data-end-ref=\"04026055\">NUM 26:55</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04026056\" data-end-ref=\"04026056\">NUM 26:56</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04033054\" data-end-ref=\"04033054\">NUM 33:54</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04033054\" data-end-ref=\"04033054\">NUM 33:54</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04034013\" data-end-ref=\"04034013\">NUM 34:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04036002\" data-end-ref=\"04036002\">NUM 36:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04036003\" data-end-ref=\"04036003\">NUM 36:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06014002\" data-end-ref=\"06014002\">JOS 14:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06015001\" data-end-ref=\"06015001\">JOS 15:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06016001\" data-end-ref=\"06016001\">JOS 16:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06017001\" data-end-ref=\"06017001\">JOS 17:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06017014\" data-end-ref=\"06017014\">JOS 17:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06017017\" data-end-ref=\"06017