"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"REALIA:4.9.1\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">4.9.1</span> 標題：烏陵和土明（Urim and Thummim）</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<h3 class=\"thlex-subheading\">\n          <strong>烏陵</strong> ：</h3>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： אוּרִים</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： ’urim)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02028030\" data-end-ref=\"02028030\">EXO 28:30</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03008008\" data-end-ref=\"03008008\">LEV 8:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04027021\" data-end-ref=\"04027021\">NUM 27:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05033008\" data-end-ref=\"05033008\">DEU 33:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09028006\" data-end-ref=\"09028006\">1SA 28:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15002063\" data-end-ref=\"15002063\">EZR 2:63</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16007065\" data-end-ref=\"16007065\">NEH 7:65</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： δῆλος, δήλωσις</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： dēlos, dēlōsis)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">SIR 33:3, SIR 45:10, 4MA 2:7, 1ES 5:40</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">經文出處</h2>\n<h3 class=\"thlex-subheading\">\n          <strong>土明</strong> ：</h3>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： תָּמִים</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： tamim)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014041\" data-end-ref=\"09014041\">1SA 14:41</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">來： אוּרִים</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： tumim)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02028030\" data-end-ref=\"02028030\">EXO 28:30</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03008008\" data-end-ref=\"03008008\">LEV 8:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05033008\" data-end-ref=\"05033008\">DEU 33:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"15002063\" data-end-ref=\"15002063\">EZR 2:63</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16007065\" data-end-ref=\"16007065\">NEH 7:65</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希： ἀλήθεια</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音譯： alētheia)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">SIR 45:10, 1ES 5:40</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>我們不知道烏陵和土明實際上是什麼樣子。學者有很多提議，包括黑色和白色的小石子，或者某種形式的籤。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">用途</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>大祭司使用這兩個物品，按照某種方法來獲知上帝的旨意（參<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04027021\" data-end-ref=\"04027021\">NUM 27:21</data> ；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014041\" data-end-ref=\"09014041\">1SA 14:41</data> ，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09028006\" data-end-ref=\"09028006\">1SA 28:6</data> 等）。有學者提出，胸袋（參<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">4.5.5 胸袋、胸牌 (sacred pocket, breastpiece)&lt;REALIA:4.5.5&gt;</a> ）就像口袋一樣盛放著烏陵和土明。祭司向上帝求問是或非時，從袋子裡取出的物品就指明了答案。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻譯</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>古代的譯本（如《七十士譯本》）傾向於按照字面意思來翻譯希伯來文<em>’urim</em> 和<em>tumim</em> ，將其譯作「光和完美」，或者抽象地譯成「完美的啟示」或「完全的光照」。大多數現代譯本都對這兩個詞採取音譯，但有些譯本（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Moffatt Translation (1926)\">Mft</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"German Common Language Version (Gute Nachricht Bibel)\">GECL</abbr> ）將其譯作「聖籤」，相當充分地傳達了這兩個詞的意思。有些語言可能必須將其譯成「上帝的籤」。不論採取哪種譯法，我們建議附加一個腳註，詳細解釋這兩個詞的含義。<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02028030\" data-end-ref=\"02028030\">EXO 28:30</data> 添加的腳註如下：「烏陵和土明：祭司用來察驗上帝旨意的兩個物件；具體使用方法不詳。」<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> 在這節經文的腳註是：「兩個小物件：希伯來文本作『烏陵和土明』，可能用木頭、石頭或金屬做成，用來按照某種方式獲知上帝的回答。」</p>\n<p>在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09014041\" data-end-ref=\"09014041\">1SA 14:41</data> ，希伯來文本的用詞<em>tamim</em> 與<em>tumim</em> 具有相同的輔音，但元音不同。希伯來文本沒有<em>’urim</em> 一詞。《七十士譯本》在這裡的文本較長，包含了與<em>’urim</em> 和<em>tumim</em> 對應的詞語。關於此處文本問題的討論和各種譯法，參《〈撒母耳上下〉手冊》（<em>A Handbook on The First and Second Books of Samuel</em> ），第300—301頁。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
